{"version":1,"key":"card:477","content":{"id":477,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sys","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 让你能够访问与 Python 解释器紧密相关的变量和函数"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f26b3b12-177c-438a-b6af-e979b0dcb354.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.argv","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含传递给 Python 解释器的参数，其中包括脚本名"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.exit","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 退出当前程序。你可向它提供一个整数，指出程序是否成功，这是一种 UNIX 约定。在大多数情况下，使用该参数的默认值（0，表示成功）即可。也可向它提供一个字符串，这个字符串将成为错误消息，对用户找出程序终止的原因很有帮助。在这种情况下，程序退出时将显示指定的错误消息以及一个表示失败的编码"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"映射 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.modules","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将模块名映射到模块（仅限于当前已导入的模块）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.path","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个字符串列表，其中的每个字符串都是一个目录名，执行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"import","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句时将在这些目录中查找模块"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.platform","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（一个字符串）是运行解释器的“平台”名称"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.stdin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.stdout","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.stderr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是类似于文件的流对象，表示标准的UNIX概念：标准输入、标准输出和标准错误。简单地说，Python 从 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.stdin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取输入（例如，用于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"input","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中），并将输出打印到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sys.stdout","code":true}]}]}]}],"tags":["Python/标准库/sys"],"createTime":1719398405066,"updateTime":1743303640442,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640442}}